              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, heavy armour, shield, lance, and warhorse. Warhorses may be given cloth barding (+3 pts). First Charge. Veteran. May count a Rank Bonus of up to +1 in combat. 1+ unit. (Vlad the Impaler p.93)</characteristic>
