              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, bow, and horse. May have shield (+2 pts) and javelins (free). Nomad Cavalry. Skirmishers. Allies and Mercenaries. (Vlad the Impaler p.93)</characteristic>
