  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="5e4a-66b5-4fe9-cf1f" name="Achaian Franks (Vlad the Impaler) - List Notes" publicationId="dab5-785d-be28-f228" hidden="false">
      <description>ARMIES OF THE FRANKS (Vlad the Impaler, pp.92-93): the Achaian Franks (Frankish Greece). Allies from other lists are documented only.

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Achaian Franks]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Cavalry: up to 75%
  Infantry: up to 50%
  Allies and Mercenaries: up to 50%
  ARMIES OF THE FRANKS. Characters up to 25%; Cavalry up to 75% (1+ unit of Frankish Knights must be taken); Infantry up to 50% (may take 0-1 Mangonel for each 2,000 pts); Allies up to 50% - the Franks may take allies from any one of the following lists: Byzantine Empire, Italian Condotta (Venetians only) from Armies of Chivalry, the Catalan Company; in addition, they may select any number of units of Pronija Retainers, Provincial Pronija, Cuman Settler, Vlach, and Bulgar Horse Archers from the Bulgar list (documented only). All units from these lists are subject to the Allies and Mercenaries rule.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
